{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415708","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415708","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041570801:0":{"text":"왜 루몬트를, 그렇게 쳐다보는 거죠?","source_cn":"为什么，盯着噜噜？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FC6BBC2563BEFB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041570802:0":{"text":"건장한 체격에 두꺼운 팔다리, 송곳니는 마치 칼날처럼 반짝이는군.","source_cn":"体格强壮，臂膀宽厚，角牙如刀锋一般锃亮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDEA257BD9702168","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041570803:0":{"text":"...게다가 이렇게 무거운 나무을 가볍게 휘두르는 것을 보면, 부족 최강의 전사일 것 같은데?","source_cn":"——还能轻松挥舞这样沉重的巨木。你一定是部族中最强的战士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96B8D4D2E34DBD1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041570804:0":{"text":"루몬트는 전사가 아니라 그림을, 그리는 토템 마스터죠!","source_cn":"噜噜不是战士。噜噜是，画画的图腾师！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3D3AD8516D16270","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041570805:1":{"text":"토템 마스터? 전사가 아니라니...","source_cn":"图腾师？你竟然不是战士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA553CA47B9A659B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041570806:1":{"text":"너희 부족에서는 토템 마스터도 용맹한 전사인 건가?","source_cn":"还是说，在你的部族中，连图腾师都如此骁勇善战？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55FED1024C4D8C31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041570807:1":{"text":"용... 네?","source_cn":"骁……勇？不明白。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C208A7BFCC5239C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041570808:1":{"text":"네 체격과 힘 말이다.","source_cn":"我是说你的体魄，你的力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7E70A5CAB54D6CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041570809:1":{"text":"아... 루몬트는 덩치도 크고 힘도 세죠.","source_cn":"哦……噜噜块头大，力气大！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0945C4582A107857","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041570810:1":{"text":"이건, 타고난 거예요. 그래서 루몬트는 돌격에 잘 어울려요.","source_cn":"这些是，天生的！所以噜噜适合冲锋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EEF23073C282521","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041570811:1":{"text":"그래. 넌 최강의 전사가 될 잠재력이 있지.","source_cn":"没错，你有潜力成为最强的战士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A4A837EC1297632","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041570812:1":{"text":"그런데 네 부족은 왜 너를 무시하는 거지? 설마 말투가 어눌해서?","source_cn":"所以，你的族人为何忽视了你？难道仅仅因为你口齿不够伶俐？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A721D2586519394","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041570813:1":{"text":"네? 아무도 루몬트 무시 안 해요... 루몬트는, 그림 그리기가 좋아요!","source_cn":"没有人忽略噜噜……噜噜喜欢画画！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x947B32D4729CDECC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041570814:1":{"text":"루몬트가 든, 이 토템. 예쁘지 않아요?","source_cn":"你看噜噜手里的，图腾，是不是很好看？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22D27946E797A540","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041570815:1":{"text":"루몬트가 그린 거예요.","source_cn":"它是噜噜画的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50018CD4AABE5AB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041570816:1":{"text":"그림은 잘 모르지만 꽤 묵직해 보이는군.","source_cn":"我不了解绘画，但我看得出它的重量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A51F7CC03693C32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041570817:1":{"text":"분명히 수도 없이 갈고 닦았겠지.","source_cn":"它一定经过了千锤百炼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9264E47D7681565","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041570818:1":{"text":"네! 루몬트가 자주 덧칠을 해서...","source_cn":"嗯嗯！噜噜经常给它补色……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E5180A155239C07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041570819:1":{"text":"...아, 여기가, 또 벗겨졌네...","source_cn":"……啊！这里，又破了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95940645F6B928A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041570820:1":{"text":"그럼 루몬트는 이만 그림 그리러 갈게요!","source_cn":"噜噜，去画画了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DED7BAE2A8499B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041570821:1":{"text":"퇴각조차 이렇게 재빠르다니... 전사가 되지 못한 게 안타깝군.","source_cn":"连撤退都如此迅速……没有成为战士，真是可惜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CA4A70CDD517601","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:噜噜":{"text":"루몬트","source":"噜噜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:戈丹":{"text":"고르단","source":"戈丹","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":22,"localized_text_count":21,"speaker_count":2}}